  },
  "description": "Client-facing view of a single Kafka topic: throughput, consumer lag in seconds, partition skew, retention headroom, and a platform-health triage row. Built from broker-side metrics only (kafka_exporter, JMX exporter, node exporter, blackbox exporter).",
