      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### How to read this row\n\nThese numbers describe the **platform**, not your application.\n\n- **All green, but your lag is growing** \u2192 the cause is on your side: consumer\n  pods down, slow processing, a rebalance loop, or a hot partition. Go to the\n  **Consumers** and **Partition balance** rows.\n- **Anything red here** \u2192 platform-side. Raise it with the Kafka team; your\n  application is a victim, not the cause.\n"
      },
